  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "系統分析與設計",
    "sub_ename": "INFORMATION SYSTEM ANALYSIS & DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "課程目的在介紹系統分析與設計的實際方法。定義並詳細說明系統開發生命週期的五階段： 系統規劃，系統分析，系統設計，系統實作和系統運作。幫助學生了解何謂系統、如何有條理的研究一個系統，以及需要哪些重要的工具和技巧。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to introduce a practical approach to system analysis and design. Define and describe in detail the five phases of the system development life cycle: system planning, system analysis, system design, system implementation, and system operation. Students could learn about what a system is, how a system can be studied systematically, and which tools and techniques are essential to such a study.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
